  "synopsis": "OMGkawaiiAngel—also known as KAngel—is one of the internet's most recognizable streamers, drawing attention from fans and fellow creators alike through her constant online presence. Behind the screen, however, her offline life as Ame reveals a far more lonely reality.\n\nAs rival streamers rise alongside her and those around her struggle to find their own place within this attention-driven digital world, Ame continues to balance the relentless expectations surrounding KAngel with the person she is away from the screen.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]",
